        ecuType: "Bosch MED 17.7.5 (Revised ME-SFI calibration for the first facelift. Features slightly more aggressive ignition and boost maps to elevate the base model's performance. The torque management software precisely limits the 630 Nm in lower gears to protect the 7-speed dual-clutch transaxle.)", 
