            "Hot-V Turbo Heat Damage: The immense heat trapped in the V-valley bakes and cracks the factory plastic turbo coolant return lines, leading to sudden coolant leaks.",
            "Electronic E-Diff Actuator Failure: The GT S features an electronic rear differential. The actuator motors can fail under heavy track use.",
            "Torque Tube / Driveshaft Bearing Whine: A carbon-fiber driveshaft connects the front engine to the rear transaxle. The internal bearings wear out, causing a high-pitched whine.",
