            "E-Diff Overheating - Aggressive track use in RACE mode without adequate cooldown laps will overheat the electronic rear differential.",
            "DCT Clutch Pack Failure - Tuning the engine without raising the TCU clamping pressure will rapidly burn the wet clutch packs in the transaxle.",
            "Torque Tube Bearing Collapse - Ignoring drivetrain vibrations will cause the driveshaft bearings to collapse inside the torque tube."
