            automatics: [ { name: "AMG SPEEDSHIFT DCT 7-Speed (Transaxle + E-Diff)", torqueLimit: "800 Nm (Stock Clamping)", oilType: "DCT Fluid (Specific AMG Specs)", note: "Mounted at the rear axle. In OPF models, thermal management of the DCT is critical as the restricted exhaust radiates more heat towards the transaxle. Features a highly advanced electronic limited-slip differential." } ] 
