            oilAndCooling: { oilSquirters: "Yes, dedicated high-flow piston cooling jets.", oilPumpType: "Fully variable displacement vane pump.", thermostatOpening: "Electronically mapped by ECU (48V Electric Water Pump).", oilCooler: "Integrated coolant-to-oil heat exchanger." }, 
