        timingType: "Chain (Located at the FRONT of the engine block. The M177 in the C192 chassis utilizes a traditional wet sump. Timing chains are incredibly robust, rarely experiencing stretch unless oil maintenance is ignored and extreme OPF heat damages the oil's viscosity.)", 
