        engineLifespan: "200,000 - 300,000+ km (The core M177 engine block is a forged masterpiece. Since the GT 55 is artificially software-detuned to 476 hp, the internal components are operating well below their mechanical limits. The engine block itself is virtually bulletproof, though peripheral items like turbo coolant lines are stressed by OPF heat.)", 
