        timingType: "Chain (Located at the FRONT of the engine block. Utilizes a traditional wet sump. Timing chains are robust on the M177, but the PRO is a track-oriented vehicle; extreme thermal cycling from continuous track days makes strict oil maintenance absolutely mandatory to protect the tensioners.)", 
