        engineLifespan: "150,000 - 250,000 km (The core M177 block is a forged masterpiece. However, the 'PRO' moniker implies heavy track use. The engine's lifespan won't be dictated by the pistons, but by the myriad of additional cooling circuits (water pumps for the differentials and transfer case) and the sheer heat generated by pushing 612 hp continuously on a circuit.)", 
