        timingType: "Chain (Features a central balance shaft driven by the timing chain. WARNING: Early M272 engines are infamous for premature wear of the balance shaft sprocket due to soft sintered metal. This leads to chain stretch, jumped timing, and severe engine damage. Fixing it requires complete engine removal.)", 
