            "ECU Heat Death - The Bosch ME9.7 ECU sits directly on the hottest part of the engine. Over 15 years, the thermal cycling destroys the PCB.",
            "Airmatic Suspension Collapse - The heavy W251 chassis destroys Airmatic airbags and compressors, dropping the car to the ground overnight."
