        engineLifespan: "200,000 - 350,000+ km (Heavily dependent on the production year and maintenance history. Post-2008 models, or those with verified balance shaft repairs, are extremely durable. However, US models often suffer from degraded fuel system components due to high ethanol (E10/E15) content in American gasoline over long periods.)", 
