            { stage: "Stage 3", power: "600+ hp", notes: "Custom Twin-Turbo kit. The forged M119 bottom end is virtually indestructible under boost, transforming the W140 into a highway terror.", zeroToHundred: "4.5s", hundredToTwoHundred: "10.5s" } 
