        euroStandard: "Euro 2", 
        maxPowerStockInternals: "650+ hp (The M119 bottom end is legendary. Featuring forged connecting rods and an overbuilt forged crankshaft, it handles massive boost effortlessly, proving itself as the basis for Mercedes' Le Mans race engines.)",
