        timingType: "Double-Roller Chain (An incredibly long and heavy timing chain. The chain itself is bulletproof, but the upper plastic chain guides bake in the immense V12 heat. They turn dark brown, become brittle, and snap. Derailing this chain destroys 48 valves instantly.)", 
        injectionType: "Sequential Multi-Point Port Injection. Twin Bosch LH-Jetronic ECUs. The engine operates effectively as two independent inline-6 engines joined at the crank, with two Mass Air Flow sensors, two throttles, and unrestricted full-load enrichment maps for brutal power delivery.", 
        engineLifespan: "300,000 - 500,000+ km (The closed-deck aluminum block with Alusil liners is immortal. However, the immense under-hood heat bakes every piece of rubber and plastic to dust. The engine usually dies from catastrophic electrical fires or neglected timing guides.)", 
        turboType: "Naturally Aspirated (A masterpiece of breathing efficiency, producing a turbine-smooth wave of 580 Nm torque without forced induction. The basis for the legendary Pagani Zonda engine.)", 
