            "Plastic Timing Chain Guides: The immense heat bakes the upper chain guides until they snap, threatening the entire valvetrain.", 
            "Valve Cover Gasket Leaks: The magnesium valve covers weep oil directly into the deep spark plug wells, drowning the plugs and causing severe misfires.", 
            "Crushed Front Suspension: The sheer mass of the M120 V12 obliterates lower ball joints, control arm bushings, and shock mounts prematurely.", 
