            "Irreplaceable EZL Failure - If either of the two EZL ignition modules overheats, the car will run on half its cylinders or not at all. Finding functional replacements is a massive financial burden.", 
            "Throttle Actuator Lockout - Degraded wiring inside the dual ETAs forces the car into a violent limp mode where the throttle pedal ceases to function, stranding the vehicle.", 
