            "Throttle Actuator Lockout - Degraded wiring inside the dual ETAs forces the car into a violent limp mode where the throttle pedal ceases to function, stranding the vehicle.", 
            "ADS Suspension Collapse - The Adaptive Damping System (ADS) shocks leak hydraulic fluid under the extreme weight of the V12, dropping the ride height and causing a bouncy, dangerous ride.", 
            "Mechanical Fan Clutch Explosion - The seized mechanical fan clutch will over-spin the massive plastic fan blades at high RPM, shattering them and sending shrapnel through the radiator and hood.", 
            "Transmission Conductor Failure (1996+) - The 722.6 conductor plate shorts out, throwing the car into a violent limp mode that strands the vehicle at highway speeds." 
