            "Throttle Actuator Lockout - Failing ETA potentiometers force the car into a violent ASR limp mode where the throttle pedal ceases to function.", 
            "ADS Suspension Collapse - The Adaptive Damping System (ADS) shocks leak hydraulic fluid under the extreme weight of the V12, dropping the ride height and causing a dangerous ride.", 
            "Mechanical Fan Clutch Explosion - A seized mechanical fan clutch will over-spin the massive plastic fan blades at high RPM, shattering them and sending shrapnel through the radiator.", 
            "Rear Main Seal Hemorrhage - Aging rubber at the back of the massive crankshaft hardens, requiring full transmission removal to stop oil from pouring onto the exhaust." 
