            "Valve Cover Breather Leaks: PCV breather hoses harden and snap. The breather chambers clog with carbon, forcing oil out of the valve cover gaskets.", 
            "Airmatic Suspension Collapse: Air struts crack, valve blocks leak, and the compressor relay sticks on, burning out the pump.", 
            "Water Ingress & SAM Module Failure: Clogged cowl drains flood the passenger footwell, permanently frying the SAM modules and Transmission Control Unit (TCU).", 
            "Transmission Pilot Bushing Leak: The 722.6 electrical connector O-rings fail, allowing ATF to wick up the wiring harness directly into the TCU.",
