            "Injector 'Black Death': Leaking copper seals encase the V8 injectors in hard carbon. Accessing the rear injectors against the firewall is incredibly difficult.", 
            "Twin Turbo Actuator Failure: The variable geometry mechanisms stick due to soot buildup and heat, causing sudden limp mode.", 
            "Airmatic Suspension Collapse: Air struts crack, valve blocks leak, and the compressor relay sticks on, burning out the pump.", 
            "Transmission Pilot Bushing Leak: ATF leaks from the connector and wicks up the wiring harness into the computer.",
            "Catastrophic Rust: Pre-facelift models suffer from severe, terminal rust on doors, wheel arches, and suspension mounts." 
