        timingType: "Double-Roller Chain (CRITICAL VULNERABILITY: Early M272 3.5L engines are plagued by the catastrophic 'Balance Shaft Failure'. The central balance shaft gear was manufactured using improperly hardened sintered metal. The timing chain literally chews the teeth off this gear, throwing timing codes (P0016/P0017) and eventually destroying the engine if not caught early. Repair requires complete engine removal and splitting the case.)", 
