        engineLifespan: "150,000 - 350,000+ km (The engine's life depends entirely on the balance shaft gear. If it is an early model, it WILL fail. Once the updated, hardened gear is installed, the M272 block is remarkably durable and will easily outlast the air suspension and interior electronics of the W221.)", 
        turboType: "Naturally Aspirated (Relies heavily on the variable intake manifold and the short, tightly packed ratios of the 7G-Tronic transmission to provide adequate acceleration. It is sufficient for city driving, but severely lacks the effortless highway passing power of the larger V8 models.)", 
