        injectionType: "Common Rail Direct Injection with CAMTRONIC. Bosch MD1. Operates at a massive 2500 bar rail pressure. Features innovative CAMTRONIC variable valve lift on the exhaust side to rapidly heat up the exhaust gas aftertreatment system, paired with multi-stage (high-pressure and low-pressure cooled) EGR.", 
