        turboType: "Variable Geometry Turbocharger (VGT). Single twin-scroll turbocharger with electronic actuator. Delivers an effortless 600 Nm of torque from just 1,200 RPM, working seamlessly with the 9G-Tronic transmission to provide smooth, uninterrupted thrust.", 
