            "OPF Asphyxiation - If the Gasoline Particulate Filter becomes permanently clogged, exhaust backpressure will skyrocket, instantly melting the exhaust-gas turbocharger and severely damaging the engine.", 
            "Electric Compressor Burnout - The eZV spins at absurd speeds. If its cooling circuit fails, the bearings will seize, throwing the engine into limp mode.", 
