        timingType: "Single-Row Chain with Gear Drive (Located at the rear of the engine block against the firewall. A robust design, but if the chain stretches due to neglected oil changes over extreme mileage, the 9G-Tronic transmission must be dropped to service it.)", 
        injectionType: "Common Rail Direct Injection with CAMTRONIC. Bosch MD1. The S 400 d features heavily revised software pushing the maximum rail pressure to a staggering 2500 bar. Exhaust CAMTRONIC ensures rapid heating of the aftertreatment system.", 
