        turboType: "Two-Stage Sequential Turbocharging. Features a high-pressure and a low-pressure turbocharger managed dynamically by the ECU. Delivers a violent 700 Nm of torque, forcing the Bosch MD1 software to run strict torque-limiting routines to prevent shattering the 9G-Tronic transmission on kickdown.", 
